integration. The game engine is licensed under GNU GPL version 2 or later.

Upstream: https://github.com/SuperTux/supertux
Pinned commit: see source_pin.json

Planned patches (not yet applied in Phase 0 scaffold):
  001-funlife-brand.patch
  002-configurable-player-sprite.patch
  003-jni-funlife-bridge.patch

FunLife application shell (Compose) is separate from GPL engine sources.
Dynamic linking via libsupertux2.so — legal review required before store release.

Full corresponding source will be published per GPL when fork binaries ship.
